  "definition": "Deer Registration Stations",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-06-01",
  "historyNote": "#1670, eff 11-20-80; ss by #2119, eff 8-12-82; ss by #2832, eff 8-21-84; ss by #4649, eff 7-24-89; ss by #6250, eff 5-22-96 (See Revision Note at part heading for Fis 301); amd by #6520, eff 5-31-97; ss by #7699, eff 6-5-02; ss by #8085, eff 5-26-04; amd by #9720-A, eff 6-5-10, (paras (a), (e), & (g)-(i)); amd by #9720-B, eff 6-5-10, (paras (b)-(d) and (f)); ss by #12591, eff 7-25-18; ss by #13644, eff 6-1-23",
